add('scheme-precedence','behavior','What precedence does Context.Scheme use when TLS and proxy scheme headers are present?', 'TLS forces https first; otherwise X-Forwarded-Proto, X-Forwarded-Protocol, X-Forwarded-Ssl==on, X-Url-Scheme, URL.Scheme, then http are checked in that order.',[('context.go','func (c *Context) Scheme','Context.Scheme')])
add('form-whitespace-types','behavior','Are spaces trimmed when assigning a form value to a string, and how does this differ for numeric types?', 'setWithProperType preserves spaces for reflect.String; after custom parser attempts it trims spaces for other kinds before conversion.',[('binding/form_mapping.go','func setWithProperType','setWithProperType')])
