add('request-context-value','behavior','How does Context.Value prioritize special keys, stored string keys and request-context values?', 'ContextRequestKey returns Request; ContextKey returns c; a stored string key returns its Context value; otherwise request context is consulted only if hasRequestContext is true.',[('context.go','func (c *Context) Value(','Context.Value')])
add('html-debug-production','architecture/facets','How do HTMLDebug and HTMLProduction differ when creating a render instance?', 'HTMLProduction.Instance reuses its stored template; HTMLDebug.Instance invokes loadTemplate for each instance. loadTemplate prioritizes Files, then Glob, then FileSystem with Patterns, applies delimiters/functions and panics when no source exists.',[('render/html.go','func (r HTMLProduction) Instance','HTMLProduction.Instance'),('render/html.go','func (r HTMLDebug) Instance','HTMLDebug.Instance'),('render/html.go','func (r HTMLDebug) loadTemplate','HTMLDebug.loadTemplate')])
add('mapping-pointer-fields','architecture/facets','How does form mapping handle nil pointers and unexported or ignored struct fields?', 'mapping ignores tag -, allocates a temporary target for a nil pointer and installs it only if mapping sets something, recursively traverses struct fields and skips unexported non-anonymous fields.',[('binding/form_mapping.go','func mapping(','mapping')])
add('optional-query-interface','architecture/facets','How is QUERY exposed without adding a new method to the legacy IRoutes contract?', 'QUERY is declared in separate IQueryRoutes; IRoutes has its existing methods and no QUERY; RouterGroup.QUERY forwards MethodQuery to handle. The interfaces allow an assertion for QUERY support.',[('routergroup.go','type IRoutes interface','IRoutes'),('routergroup.go','type IQueryRoutes interface','IQueryRoutes'),('routergroup.go','func (group *RouterGroup) QUERY','RouterGroup.QUERY')])
